jobDescription:
- Responsible for trading tasks of the polymers/chemicals/rubber according to business plans of The Company;
- Look for new customers & take care of assigned customers; build and maintain good relationships with clients as well as partners in the polymer industry to ensure continuous business growth and ability to negotiate and create win-win situations;
- Analyze, and identify trends in both global and local markets to identify suitable sales channels and pricing for business development;
- Take part in conferences of the polymer industry in Vietnam or overseas;
- Coordinate with relevant departments for completion of administrative sales services such as contract preparation and shipment logistics…;
- Daily, weekly, and monthly monitoring and updating of sales activities or other market reports when requested;
- Manage the debt collection system and program to ensure a low outstanding debt ratio.

requirements:
- Qualification: Graduated Foreign from top universities in Vietnam such as Foreign Trade University, National Economics University, RMIT,… or overseas universities.
- Experience: From 1 - 3 years of experience in export sales or fresh graduate with high passion in sales & deep knowledge in import & export.
- Skills: Good command of written and spoken in Spanish/Portuguese/Arabic language
- Excellent communication and negotiation skills;
- Time and task management;

